            "content": "What do you usually like to do when you get home? Do you still enjoy those things, or have you noticed that you've lost interest in them lately?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I love cooking. I find it really relaxing. I usually make a big mess and laugh at myself for being so clumsy."
        },
        {
