        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "What kind of thoughts do you tend to get stuck in when you're on your own?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Just the usual doubts about my life, I guess. Like, is this really it? But I don't like dwelling on that, so I try to stay positive and focus on the good stuff."
        },
        {
